### =====================================================================
### Cereri de test pentru Auction Engine (extensia VS Code "REST Client")
###
### Rulare: apasa "Send Request" deasupra fiecarei cereri, IN ORDINE.
### Token-urile si id-ul obiectului se preiau automat din raspunsurile anterioare.
### La a doua rulare, inregistrarile dau "username deja folosit" - e normal, login-ul merge in continuare.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@parola = parola123


### ---------- 1. Conturi ----------

### Inregistrare vanzator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vanzator_demo",
  "email": "vanzator_demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Inregistrare cumparator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cumparator_demo",
  "email": "cumparator_demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Login vanzator (token-ul se salveaza automat)
# @name loginVanzator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vanzator_demo",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Login cumparator (token-ul se salveaza automat)
# @name loginCumparator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cumparator_demo",
  "password": "{{parola}}"
}

### Profilul meu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 2. Obiecte ----------

### Vanzatorul pune un obiect la licitatie (2 minute, ca sa vezi inchiderea)
# @name creareObiect
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Ceas de buzunar vechi",
  "description": "Functioneaza, are o zgarietura pe capac",
  "startPrice": 100.00,
  "durationInMinutes": 2
}

### Toate obiectele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Doar licitatiile deschise
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/active
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Detaliile obiectului creat mai sus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Obiectele puse la licitatie de vanzator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/my
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 3. Licitare ----------

### Cumparatorul liciteaza (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 150.00
}

### EROARE asteptata: oferta prea mica (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 120.00
}

### EROARE asteptata: vanzatorul liciteaza la propriul obiect (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Istoricul ofertelor pentru obiect (de la cea mai mare)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

### Ofertele mele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/my
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Cumparatorul urmareste obiectul (lista de favorite, "Urmaresc")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Obiectele urmarite de cumparator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/watched
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### EROARE asteptata: vanzatorul isi urmareste propriul obiect (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

### Cumparatorul nu mai urmareste obiectul
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/watch
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}


### ---------- 3b. Wallet, questions, reports, recommendations ----------

### Buyer's wallet (balance, reserved for auctions they lead, available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Buyer tops up the wallet (test credits, max 5000 at once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/top-up
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "amount": 500
}

### Buyer asks a public question about the item
# @name intrebare
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "text": "Are factura si garantie?"
}

### Seller answers (only the seller, only once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/questions/{{intrebare.response.body.$.id}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "text": "Da, garantie inca un an."
}

### Questions and answers (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/questions

### Buyer reports the item (FRAUD, PROHIBITED, WRONG_CATEGORY, OFFENSIVE, OTHER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/report
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "reason": "WRONG_CATEGORY",
  "details": "Ar trebui la Electronice"
}

### Recommendations for the buyer (active items from the categories they bid on / watch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Dutch auction: the price drops by 10 RON per minute down to 100 RON; "buy-now" buys at the current price
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Lampa vintage (olandeza)",
  "description": "Licitatie olandeza de test",
  "startPrice": 300.00,
  "durationInMinutes": 60,
  "auctionType": "DUTCH",
  "floorPrice": 100.00,
  "priceDrop": 10.00
}

### Public VAPID key for browser push notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/push/public-key

### Is "Sign in with Google" configured? (clientId is null when GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/config


### ---------- 4. Dupa inchiderea licitatiei ----------
### Asteapta ~2-3 minute (durata + verificarea care ruleaza o data pe minut)

### Obiectele castigate de cumparator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/won
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### EROARE asteptata: licitatie incheiata (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "itemId": {{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}},
  "amount": 1000.00
}


### Cautare cu AI (merge doar cu ANTHROPIC_API_KEY setat; altfel 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "query": "un ceas vechi sub 500 lei in Cluj"
}

### Verifica lantul criptografic al ofertelor (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bids/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/verify

### Comenzile mele (cumparaturi si vanzari, cu escrow)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Comanda obiectului vandut (cumparatorul, vanzatorul sau un admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Colectie noua (lista personala de licitatii)
# @name colectie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "Cadouri de Craciun",
  "publicList": true
}

### Adauga obiectul in colectie
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{colectie.response.body.$.id}}/items/{{creareObiect.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCumparator.response.body.$.token}}

### Colectia (publica, fara token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collections/{{colectie.response.body.$.id}}

### ---------- 5. Erori de validare si autentificare ----------

### EROARE asteptata: date invalide la inregistrare (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "email": "nu-e-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### EROARE asteptata: obiect fara nume si cu pret negativ (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVanzator.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "",
  "startPrice": -5
}

### EROARE asteptata: fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items

### EROARE asteptata: token invalid (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer token-inventat
